WEBVTT

00:17.080 --> 00:19.210
♪ We'll follow Zhang Xie to the capital ♪

00:20.510 --> 00:24.390
♪ Lest he prove untrue
and leave us heartbroken ♪

00:29.320 --> 00:31.320
This southern opera
is being performed tonight

00:30.820 --> 00:33.250
♪ Today Zhang Xie rides through
the streets in triumph ♪

00:31.710 --> 00:34.560
to welcome you into the household.

00:33.570 --> 00:35.100
♪ But he's short of helping hands ♪

00:35.640 --> 00:37.600
Back then, your mother

00:36.140 --> 00:38.310
♪ Let's go lend him ours ♪

00:38.790 --> 00:40.470
loved this piece the most as well.

00:40.320 --> 00:42.850
♪ The ghosts will bear the sedan chair ♪

00:45.310 --> 00:47.750
♪ The gods will blow the trumpets ♪

01:00.070 --> 01:09.360
♪ Decked in red and clad in green ♪

01:00.110 --> 01:03.370
When I was young, I lived
alone and destitute far from home,

01:03.670 --> 01:05.530
growing up among the common folk.

01:05.590 --> 01:08.480
My birth mother once committed
a grave mistake

01:08.840 --> 01:10.100
and harmed her family.

01:19.039 --> 01:20.120
But was my mother

01:21.070 --> 01:23.070
truly a sinner?

01:24.280 --> 01:28.480
My mother had once entered the grand gates
of the Xie Residence full of hope.

01:29.000 --> 01:30.840
Yet behind those vermilion gates...

01:30.840 --> 01:32.430
A lowly actress like you

01:32.430 --> 01:34.680
isn't worthy of living in Danyue Pavilion!

01:34.680 --> 01:37.870
-Help! Concubine Xia's been murdered!
-In the end, my mother

01:37.870 --> 01:39.850
was accused of murder.

01:40.870 --> 01:43.200
Our Xie family's century-old reputation

01:43.200 --> 01:46.509
will not be sullied
by a vile, treacherous woman like you.

01:47.070 --> 01:48.000
After that,

01:48.310 --> 01:50.120
my mother chose to bear the shame

01:50.200 --> 01:52.000
and leave the Xie Residence

01:52.200 --> 01:53.600
with me still in her womb.

01:55.479 --> 01:57.280
She and I depended on each other.

01:57.840 --> 01:59.039
Our life was humble,

01:59.640 --> 02:00.770
but we were content.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.920
Yet even so,

02:04.310 --> 02:05.310
there were still those in the Xie family

02:05.310 --> 02:07.310
who refused to leave us in peace.

02:18.560 --> 02:19.430
Years later,

02:20.470 --> 02:22.310
Grandmother brought me back
to the Xie Residence.

02:22.000 --> 02:24.110
[Qingyuan]

02:24.400 --> 02:26.460
And that was when Xie Qingyuan's life

02:28.520 --> 02:30.400
truly began.

02:32.300 --> 02:37.310
[Spring of The Blade]

02:37.650 --> 02:40.370
[Episode 1]

02:49.250 --> 02:51.230
[One Month Ago]

02:52.680 --> 02:55.640
[Chen Yunya]

02:57.560 --> 02:58.310
My Lady.

02:59.030 --> 03:00.280
Everything's ready.

03:01.240 --> 03:03.430
Then all we need is an opportunity.

03:03.800 --> 03:05.460
Now that the stage's been set,

03:05.590 --> 03:06.280
it's time

03:06.870 --> 03:08.080
for the show to begin.

03:45.030 --> 03:46.840
Attack!

03:52.960 --> 03:53.560
Who do you think you are?

03:53.560 --> 03:55.300
This grain is disaster relief
sent by imperial decree.

03:55.300 --> 03:56.440
Do you all have a death wish?

03:56.440 --> 03:57.520
We can't get into the city!

03:57.520 --> 04:00.520
If we don't seize this grain,
we have no way to survive!

04:00.670 --> 04:01.730
Where's the grain?

04:05.360 --> 04:06.030
Guards!

04:06.350 --> 04:08.550
Drive them to the outskirts of the city!

04:25.860 --> 04:28.440
[Wei Changyan,
Jiangnan Transport Commissioner]

04:27.160 --> 04:31.290
Greetings, My Lord. I'm Wei Changyan,
Jiangnan Transport Commissioner.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.360
Hengtang is quite lively, isn't it?

04:35.070 --> 04:37.870
I'm temporarily overseeing
affairs in Hengtang.

04:37.870 --> 04:39.070
I've failed in my duties

04:39.070 --> 04:42.070
and allowed these refugees
to disturb Your Lordship.

04:42.159 --> 04:43.420
It is my fault.

04:48.290 --> 04:51.070
[Yan Rui, Imperial Advisor
of the Ministry of Revenue]

04:52.700 --> 04:55.050
[Outskirts of Hengtang City]

04:55.920 --> 04:59.050
Is this supposed to be boiling water
or making porridge?

04:59.630 --> 05:01.680
How many grains of rice are in there?

05:02.310 --> 05:03.770
I don't see a single grain.

05:04.430 --> 05:06.120
He's just boiling plain water.

05:06.120 --> 05:08.270
They should have at least brought
half a cart of grain

05:08.270 --> 05:09.870
to tide us over for a few days.

05:09.950 --> 05:11.210
This corrupt official

05:11.490 --> 05:14.710
didn't even bother bringing
a single grain of rice.

05:16.560 --> 05:18.430
Lord Wei, you look a bit gloomy.

05:18.870 --> 05:20.600
You're not upset
that I borrowed your grain

05:20.600 --> 05:22.530
for relief distribution, are you?

05:22.950 --> 05:23.950
I wouldn't dare.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.270
It's just that today's porridge

05:26.270 --> 05:27.720
is indeed a bit thin.

05:28.430 --> 05:31.680
I'll have to trouble you to
bring more rice tomorrow, Lord Wei.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.270
Yes.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.000
My Lord.

05:34.159 --> 05:35.420
The porridge is ready.

05:41.240 --> 05:41.870
Everyone,

05:42.040 --> 05:43.300
the porridge is ready.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.890
Come and get your porridge.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.320
No rush. No rush.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.510
One at a time.

05:52.830 --> 05:53.630
Take it easy.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.490
There's enough for everyone.

05:55.510 --> 05:56.750
I know

05:57.390 --> 05:59.070
you all must feel

05:59.310 --> 06:01.270
very grateful to me right now.

06:01.950 --> 06:03.480
I bear the imperial decree,

06:03.480 --> 06:05.000
so in handling disaster relief,

06:05.000 --> 06:06.600
I'll certainly do my utmost.

06:07.000 --> 06:07.660
Easy, easy.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.610
There's enough for everyone.

06:11.160 --> 06:11.920
Let's go.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.280
We still have important matters
to attend to.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.190
Let's not cause any trouble.

06:15.190 --> 06:16.920
One by one, no rush.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.490
Is it my turn yet?

06:21.750 --> 06:23.820
Please, I haven't gotten any yet!

06:24.000 --> 06:25.750
Me. Me first.

06:25.750 --> 06:26.920
I'm starving.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.180
You corrupt official!

06:31.800 --> 06:33.000
Protect His Lordship! Hurry!

06:33.000 --> 06:34.360
Protect His Lordship!

06:39.630 --> 06:40.930
Don't run! Catch him!

06:41.680 --> 06:42.340
Stop there!

06:42.510 --> 06:43.500
Are you alright, My Lord?

06:43.500 --> 06:44.100
I'm fine.

06:44.650 --> 06:45.650
Don't run!

06:51.040 --> 06:51.800
Freeze!

06:53.470 --> 06:54.150
Stop!

06:54.750 --> 06:55.430
Stop!

07:01.510 --> 07:03.040
-Let go of me!
-My Lady.

07:03.070 --> 07:04.440
The road's blocked.

07:10.630 --> 07:12.550
Do whatever you want to me!

07:12.600 --> 07:15.800
-I won't beg for mercy!
-You seem to have a problem with me.

07:17.270 --> 07:18.430
I originally thought that

07:18.430 --> 07:20.830
since you came all the way
from the capital,

07:20.830 --> 07:22.430
you must be someone
who actually gets things done.

07:22.430 --> 07:24.270
Who would have thought
that you're even more hateful,

07:24.270 --> 07:25.270
more despicable,

07:25.390 --> 07:27.000
and more disgusting than them!

07:27.000 --> 07:28.650
You live in luxury, sparing no expense
on your own food and clothes,

07:28.650 --> 07:30.040
yet there's not a grain of relief rice
for the people!

07:30.040 --> 07:32.110
Not a single grain!

07:33.600 --> 07:34.360
Are you done?

07:42.800 --> 07:44.800
I know you've suffered a lot.

07:45.040 --> 07:46.510
So trust me.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.950
I came this time

07:49.270 --> 07:50.400
specifically to...

08:58.480 --> 08:59.840
Such an exquisite item.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.390
From now on,

09:15.150 --> 09:16.790
whenever you see me,

09:17.390 --> 09:18.520
keep your distance.

09:28.550 --> 09:31.320
[Xie Residence in Hengtang]

09:32.200 --> 09:35.910
[Danyue Pavilion]

09:42.440 --> 09:43.520
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

09:43.550 --> 09:45.030
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

09:46.120 --> 09:47.670
A letter from the Northern Frontier!

09:47.670 --> 09:49.730
A letter from the Northern Frontier!

09:51.870 --> 09:54.080
What on earth happened?

09:54.240 --> 09:55.710
How did he end up

09:56.000 --> 09:57.790
offending the royal family?

09:57.790 --> 09:58.540
Nonsense.

09:59.550 --> 10:01.150
Bothering Mother like this.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.520
My poor son, Zhenglun...

10:10.630 --> 10:12.480
He's been guarding that bitterly cold
Northern Frontier

10:12.480 --> 10:13.840
for years,

10:14.000 --> 10:16.660
and now he actually has to
suffer this calamity.

10:18.080 --> 10:20.780
[Old Madam Xie]

10:18.510 --> 10:20.440
Serving as an official in the court

10:20.670 --> 10:22.030
always comes with rises and falls.

10:21.470 --> 10:23.160
[Hu Wenzhuo,
Head Madam of the Xie Family]

10:22.360 --> 10:23.960
Things like this happen.

10:23.590 --> 10:25.270
[Lian Fanqiao,
Third Concubine of the Xie Family]

10:24.510 --> 10:26.910
It won't shake the century-old foundations

10:26.910 --> 10:28.750
of our Xie family.

10:29.240 --> 10:31.670
How can we panic and lose our composure

10:32.200 --> 10:33.910
over just a minor hardship?

10:32.280 --> 10:34.000
[Mei Yinghua,
Second Concubine of the Xie Family]

10:35.390 --> 10:37.240
Especially you.

10:37.550 --> 10:39.840
As the head madam of the Xie household,

10:40.240 --> 10:41.840
you've lost your composure—

10:42.000 --> 10:45.460
how can you ever be entrusted
with greater responsibilities?

10:46.870 --> 10:49.130
Your reprimand is justified, Old Madam.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.440
But there is one thing

10:51.200 --> 10:52.240
I

10:52.630 --> 10:54.160
must bring up nonetheless.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.040
A blood-written poem

10:56.200 --> 10:57.720
suddenly appeared at Danyue Pavilion

10:57.720 --> 10:59.480
a few months ago,

10:59.800 --> 11:00.270
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

11:00.290 --> 11:01.110
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

11:01.960 --> 11:03.120
saying things like

11:03.150 --> 11:05.630
Old Madam would be ill for a long time
without recovery,

11:05.630 --> 11:07.760
Master would be demoted for no reason,

11:07.790 --> 11:15.280
[Danyue Pavilion]

11:07.870 --> 11:09.790
and that the others in the household

11:09.790 --> 11:11.520
would also suffer misfortune.

11:12.310 --> 11:14.840
An official robe, a burial mound.

11:15.220 --> 11:18.300
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.

11:18.420 --> 11:21.370
Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.

11:21.470 --> 11:24.510
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.

11:25.840 --> 11:28.480
I entered the Xie household at 19,

11:29.150 --> 11:30.870
and I've spent my life
managing the trading house,

11:30.870 --> 11:32.470
keeping the inner household in order,

11:32.470 --> 11:35.270
and dealing with all manner of
demons and schemes—

11:35.670 --> 11:37.000
what manner of specter

11:37.270 --> 11:38.320
have I not seen?

11:38.630 --> 11:39.320
And now

11:39.750 --> 11:42.390
you little rats think you can frighten me?

11:43.000 --> 11:44.130
Go and assign people

11:44.240 --> 11:46.510
to recite the Kṣitigarbha Sutra
in the ancestral hall

11:46.510 --> 11:47.720
around the clock.

11:49.720 --> 11:51.030
Let's see whether

11:51.390 --> 11:53.840
you vicious ghosts are more fearsome,

11:54.240 --> 11:58.300
or whether the ancestral tablets
of our Xie family carry greater weight!

11:58.360 --> 11:59.080
Zhengjun!

11:59.630 --> 12:00.600
Go and douse it

12:01.080 --> 12:02.200
with dog blood!

12:02.670 --> 12:03.510
Me?

12:11.360 --> 12:13.540
[Xie Zhengjun,
Second Young Master of the Xie Family]

12:19.870 --> 12:20.670
Young Master!

12:25.080 --> 12:26.120
You bastard!

12:26.270 --> 12:27.470
You're finally back!

12:27.630 --> 12:29.790
You might as well come back tomorrow
and collect my corpse!

12:29.790 --> 12:31.790
Young Master, black dog blood
isn't easy to get.

12:31.790 --> 12:32.750
The butcher at the market

12:32.750 --> 12:33.390
had to slaughter one fresh.

12:33.390 --> 12:34.720
It's been 2 whole hours.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.600
In that amount of time, even ghosts
could've reincarnated 3 times over!

12:36.600 --> 12:38.360
Do you have any idea what I went through?

12:38.360 --> 12:39.080
I do, I do.

12:39.270 --> 12:40.600
Please stop complaining.

12:40.600 --> 12:42.330
-Just splash it.
-Give it to me.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.120
What's that sound?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.030
You heard it?

12:48.480 --> 12:49.150
I didn't.

12:49.750 --> 12:50.080
I...

12:50.080 --> 12:51.410
I didn't hear anything.

12:51.790 --> 12:52.790
That's not right.

12:53.320 --> 12:53.960
That's not right.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.910
What's that sound?

12:54.910 --> 12:55.910
Did you hear that?

12:56.120 --> 12:56.840
Wufu?

12:57.150 --> 12:57.960
Wufu!

13:47.870 --> 13:48.550
Yunya.

13:49.120 --> 13:49.920
Stop singing.

13:50.360 --> 13:51.690
Let alone Xie Zhengjun,

13:52.270 --> 13:53.390
even I, who am playing a ghost,

13:53.390 --> 13:55.390
am about to be scared to death by you.

13:55.790 --> 13:58.670
That's exactly what I want—
every one of them to live in fear,

13:58.670 --> 14:00.530
their minds thrown into turmoil.

14:01.790 --> 14:04.190
Mere sleepless nights are far from enough.

14:04.240 --> 14:07.080
I want them to feel as if 10,000 arrows
were piercing their hearts.

14:07.080 --> 14:09.740
Your Yunduo has been selected
by the Xie family.

14:09.960 --> 14:10.960
This afternoon,

14:10.960 --> 14:12.550
it was taken into the Xie Residence

14:12.550 --> 14:14.410
along with several other horses.

14:16.320 --> 14:18.550
Favorable conditions
have appeared in Hengtang.

14:18.550 --> 14:21.150
It's time we made use of them.

14:31.790 --> 14:32.470
Fire!

14:32.750 --> 14:33.790
Hurry and help put out the fire!

14:33.790 --> 14:35.520
Hurry and help put out the fire!

14:36.530 --> 14:37.290
Fire!

14:37.320 --> 14:38.120
Fire!

14:38.270 --> 14:39.200
Help!

14:39.220 --> 14:40.170
Fire!

14:40.190 --> 14:40.720
Fire!

14:40.750 --> 14:41.610
Help!

14:41.800 --> 14:42.850
Fire!

14:44.000 --> 14:44.790
The curse.

14:47.810 --> 14:48.960
[Blazing flames]

14:51.420 --> 14:53.670
[Crimson eyes]

14:55.600 --> 14:56.550
It's the curse.

14:57.270 --> 14:58.600
The curse has come true!

15:01.790 --> 15:02.650
Old Madam!

15:02.790 --> 15:03.550
Old Madam!

15:04.400 --> 15:06.650
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

15:04.720 --> 15:06.280
The curse has come true!

15:07.150 --> 15:08.270
Nonsense.

15:08.440 --> 15:09.360
Old Madam!

15:09.480 --> 15:10.320
Old Madam!

15:10.390 --> 15:11.100
Old Madam!

15:11.260 --> 15:12.020
Old Madam!

15:12.240 --> 15:14.700
-The fire has spread to the east wing!
-Fire!

15:14.720 --> 15:16.600
Quick, go bring the fire brigade!

15:18.750 --> 15:19.440
Old Madam.

15:19.630 --> 15:21.150
It's the vengeful spirits
coming to claim lives.

15:21.150 --> 15:22.600
The vengeful spirits are here
to claim lives!

15:22.600 --> 15:23.480
Shut up!

15:24.350 --> 15:25.610
Help put out the fire!

15:26.910 --> 15:28.660
Help! Put out the fire!

15:30.280 --> 15:31.560
Amitabha.

15:38.640 --> 15:39.470
Fire!

15:39.490 --> 15:40.750
Help!

15:48.630 --> 15:49.720
Zuixian Tavern is truly great.

15:49.720 --> 15:50.910
Let's drink till we drop again
another day!

15:50.910 --> 15:53.240
Let's drink to our heart's content again!

15:57.050 --> 15:59.090
Something bad happened! Help!

16:00.000 --> 16:01.030
Protect Lord Yan!

16:00.860 --> 16:01.550
[Zuixian Tavern]

16:01.060 --> 16:02.290
Protect Lord Yan!

16:03.390 --> 16:03.960
My Lord!

16:04.720 --> 16:05.440
My Lord!

16:06.240 --> 16:06.960
My Lord!

16:07.270 --> 16:08.000
Stop!

16:08.260 --> 16:09.970
[Zuixian Tavern]

16:08.320 --> 16:09.240
My Lord, something bad happened!

16:09.240 --> 16:10.390
There's a fire over there!

16:10.390 --> 16:11.440
Where?

16:11.960 --> 16:13.630
It seems to be the Xie Residence.

16:13.630 --> 16:14.910
The Xie Residence?

16:14.960 --> 16:16.390
Lord Guo, quick, quick.

16:16.390 --> 16:17.550
A fire is a serious matter.

16:17.550 --> 16:18.670
Go help put it out!

16:18.960 --> 16:19.790
Yes. Got it.

16:19.790 --> 16:20.960
I will take my leave.

16:22.120 --> 16:22.750
Quick! Quick!

16:22.750 --> 16:23.120
See you.

16:23.120 --> 16:23.720
This way!

16:27.910 --> 16:28.670
This way.

16:29.550 --> 16:30.220
Follow them.

16:30.220 --> 16:30.720
Yes.

16:46.480 --> 16:47.670
Once it's burned down,

16:47.670 --> 16:49.200
it'll be your turn to beg me.

16:51.580 --> 16:52.340
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

16:52.690 --> 16:53.960
Water's here!

16:56.270 --> 16:57.270
Get out of the way!

16:57.320 --> 16:58.540
Move! Move!

16:58.870 --> 17:00.100
Hurry up!

17:03.630 --> 17:04.960
Quick, quick! Hurry up!

17:06.160 --> 17:06.960
Follow up!

17:07.030 --> 17:07.680
Be quick!

17:07.819 --> 17:08.470
Hurry up!

17:08.490 --> 17:09.000
Hurry!

17:31.960 --> 17:33.930
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

17:42.590 --> 17:43.400
Yunduo!

17:58.090 --> 17:59.400
Young lady.

18:01.150 --> 18:02.700
Is this the one you're calling for?

18:02.700 --> 18:04.100
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

18:06.020 --> 18:06.870
Stop there.

18:14.350 --> 18:16.410
What are your instructions, My Lord?

18:18.030 --> 18:19.770
Since you know who I am,

18:20.640 --> 18:22.440
and your horse almost hurt me,

18:23.000 --> 18:24.460
how should we settle this?

18:25.350 --> 18:26.480
This is not my horse.

18:27.750 --> 18:29.210
Then whose name is Yunduo?

18:29.350 --> 18:30.280
I just made it up.

18:35.110 --> 18:36.240
I have heard

18:36.270 --> 18:37.590
that some horses are easily startled

18:37.590 --> 18:38.850
and fierce-tempered,

18:38.920 --> 18:41.240
and only their owner's whistle
can calm them down.

18:41.060 --> 18:41.670
[Zuixian Tavern]

18:44.400 --> 18:46.330
As for the fire at the Xie Residence,

18:46.330 --> 18:49.530
I'm afraid you can't
escape responsibility for it, lady.

18:54.190 --> 18:56.860
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

18:57.920 --> 18:59.190
You hid flint

18:59.240 --> 19:00.740
inside sugared balls

19:01.270 --> 19:02.730
and tied them to the horse.

19:03.070 --> 19:05.030
Once the sugar melted,
the fire was ignited.

19:05.030 --> 19:06.960
And with the east wind blowing strong,

19:06.960 --> 19:08.760
the flames spread with the wind,

19:08.790 --> 19:11.450
while the evidence was destroyed
along with it.

19:12.160 --> 19:15.620
Quite an intricately orchestrated
scheme you devised, lady.

19:20.160 --> 19:22.840
And where did you get that whistle, lady?

19:23.350 --> 19:26.680
Come to think of it, that should
count as physical evidence.

19:40.960 --> 19:41.790
First arson,

19:41.790 --> 19:43.510
then destruction of evidence—

19:43.510 --> 19:45.830
do you believe I could arrest you
right now?

19:45.830 --> 19:46.630
Go ahead then.

19:49.310 --> 19:50.720
Your Lordship gave me the chance

19:50.720 --> 19:51.920
to destroy the evidence just now

19:51.920 --> 19:53.380
and did nothing to stop me.

19:53.720 --> 19:55.310
By that logic,

19:55.640 --> 19:57.370
you'd be an accomplice as well.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.110
Besides,

19:58.480 --> 19:59.830
with Your Lordship's abilities,

19:59.830 --> 20:02.640
capturing a weak woman like me
would have been effortless.

20:02.640 --> 20:05.240
If you truly intended to act, you would've
arrested me from the start.

20:05.240 --> 20:07.310
Why go through all this step by step,
pressing me like this?

20:07.310 --> 20:09.350
Your Lordship clearly
has some other motive—

20:09.350 --> 20:11.550
one you don't want others to know about.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.110
Who exactly are you?

20:26.960 --> 20:29.160
And what do you want with the Xie family?

20:32.030 --> 20:33.400
I'll get to the bottom of it.

20:33.250 --> 20:37.600
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

20:37.720 --> 20:43.470
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

20:48.200 --> 20:50.600
When heaven and earth
reverse their course

20:50.790 --> 20:52.510
and old debts return
in the cycle of reincarnation,

20:52.510 --> 20:54.450
this is the manifestation of
karmic retribution—

20:54.450 --> 20:56.380
something that cannot be avoided.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.920
What are we supposed to do now?

20:59.640 --> 21:02.590
Master is about to return
from the Northern Frontier,

21:02.590 --> 21:04.110
yet the household is in chaos—

21:04.110 --> 21:04.790
first the fire,

21:04.790 --> 21:06.140
then the hauntings,

21:06.200 --> 21:08.200
and now the talk of karmic retribution.

21:08.200 --> 21:10.280
Are they determined to see us dead?

21:10.820 --> 21:13.530
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

21:19.640 --> 21:20.900
Take these scriptures

21:21.310 --> 21:22.890
to the ancestral hall and burn them.

21:22.890 --> 21:23.590
Yes.

21:26.510 --> 21:27.530
How did it go?

21:28.200 --> 21:31.030
Did the Taoist priest
have any way to deal with this?

21:31.030 --> 21:32.660
The Taoist priest hinted

21:33.030 --> 21:35.160
that the last line of
the blood-written poem...

21:35.160 --> 21:36.690
Please do not worry, Madam.

21:37.110 --> 21:38.910
You must understand that all things
in this world

21:38.910 --> 21:41.060
[The Profound Realm of True Mystery]

21:39.110 --> 21:41.400
follow the principle of
mutual generation and restraint.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.730
Fortune and misfortune

21:42.960 --> 21:44.220
are ever intertwined.

21:44.640 --> 21:46.640
Now that calamity has befallen you,

21:47.160 --> 21:49.290
there is surely a mascot to ward it off.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.110
A mascot to ward it off?

21:51.830 --> 21:53.400
I have said all I can.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.370
[The Profound Realm of True Mystery]

21:53.430 --> 21:55.650
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

21:53.960 --> 21:55.350
A child, at last,

21:55.680 --> 21:57.890
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

21:55.920 --> 21:57.180
pays the price of fate.

21:57.590 --> 21:59.590
One of the children of the Xie family

22:00.000 --> 22:01.330
will definitely be able

22:01.550 --> 22:03.210
to resolve this predicament.

22:04.240 --> 22:07.110
It's just that if anything were to happen

22:07.240 --> 22:09.370
to one of our Xie family's children...

22:09.440 --> 22:12.440
I'm worried you wouldn't be able
to bear it, Old Madam.

22:19.640 --> 22:20.510
I've actually

22:21.350 --> 22:24.000
heard some rumors recently,

22:24.640 --> 22:25.830
about Jin Chunqing

22:26.400 --> 22:28.110
giving birth to a child

22:28.960 --> 22:31.290
after she left our residence years ago...

22:42.310 --> 22:43.160
Take a seat.

22:44.000 --> 22:44.790
Yes.

22:52.240 --> 22:53.070
Wenzhuo.

22:53.160 --> 22:53.720
Yes?

22:54.550 --> 22:55.560
You and I

22:57.070 --> 22:58.680
share the same thought.

23:02.030 --> 23:02.920
Old Madam!

23:06.000 --> 23:06.960
Old Madam.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.790
We've found that child.

23:18.710 --> 23:20.800
[Welcoming Heaven's Blessings]

23:53.640 --> 23:55.160
What would you like to buy?

24:04.310 --> 24:04.790
Wait.

24:05.480 --> 24:07.260
Yunya isn't some object

24:07.550 --> 24:10.260
you can just move around as you please.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.400
Old Madam Xie.

24:11.790 --> 24:14.000
Recognizing family ties
is a big deal, right?

24:14.000 --> 24:16.000
I have to respect her wishes on this.

24:16.110 --> 24:17.070
Please

24:17.070 --> 24:18.510
go back for today.

24:18.590 --> 24:20.520
And take all these things with you.

24:20.790 --> 24:22.290
We're a humble household—

24:22.550 --> 24:24.750
we have no use for such lavish gifts.

24:25.640 --> 24:27.770
You and Yunya are not blood relatives,

24:28.550 --> 24:31.480
but you raised her for our Xie family
all these years.

24:31.510 --> 24:33.110
No gift could be too generous

24:33.270 --> 24:34.720
for you to accept.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.550
Still,

24:37.240 --> 24:38.880
I respect your wishes.

24:39.880 --> 24:42.480
After all, one should never forcefully

24:42.640 --> 24:45.350
keep what does not belong to them.

24:46.550 --> 24:49.880
To do so would defy
heaven and moral order,

24:50.350 --> 24:52.720
and invite misfortune.

24:53.830 --> 24:56.070
Even though Yunya and I
are not blood relatives,

24:56.070 --> 24:57.240
she's still the girl our Chen family

24:57.240 --> 24:59.930
raised and cherished from childhood.

25:00.000 --> 25:02.110
How dare you think
you can just take her away?

25:02.110 --> 25:03.240
I'm telling you now,

25:03.440 --> 25:05.350
whatever tricks you have up your sleeve,

25:05.350 --> 25:07.510
I'll meet you head-on.

25:09.590 --> 25:10.920
Granny, don't.

25:26.960 --> 25:28.160
Good child.

25:31.640 --> 25:33.240
I'm your grandmother.

25:35.000 --> 25:35.550
Come.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.030
Come here.

25:37.640 --> 25:39.240
Let me take a good look at you.

25:43.750 --> 25:44.400
Dear!

25:45.160 --> 25:46.560
Don't take another step!

25:47.310 --> 25:48.720
If you take one more step,

25:48.960 --> 25:51.960
our Chen family will disown you
as our granddaughter.

25:57.680 --> 25:58.280
Come here.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.480
Granny.

26:25.750 --> 26:26.640
I'm sorry.

26:31.000 --> 26:33.600
I'm grateful for all you've done
in raising me,

26:37.070 --> 26:39.070
but I want to return to my own family.

26:43.030 --> 26:44.590
I want to see my father.

26:56.070 --> 26:56.670
Very well.

26:57.880 --> 27:00.210
You want to return to
your own family, huh?

27:00.590 --> 27:01.480
Very well.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.640
So very well!

27:04.350 --> 27:05.620
If you return to your family,

27:05.620 --> 27:07.420
then don't come back ever again!

27:16.200 --> 27:17.410
Good girl.

27:18.030 --> 27:19.550
Once you're packed,

27:20.030 --> 27:22.290
I'll send someone to come and pick you up.

27:22.590 --> 27:25.530
I'll make sure you come back
to the Xie family in glory

27:26.480 --> 27:27.630
and that

27:28.070 --> 27:29.620
you rightfully become

27:30.550 --> 27:32.470
the Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

27:39.270 --> 27:41.120
Raise the sedan!

28:13.640 --> 28:16.000
This is as far as I can help you.

28:16.550 --> 28:18.080
For the rest of the journey,

28:18.790 --> 28:20.920
you'll have to forge ahead on your own.

28:27.880 --> 28:30.740
The fire at the Xie Residence
was quite suspicious.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.350
By the way,

28:31.680 --> 28:33.350
Your Lordship asked me to investigate
the owner of the white horse,

28:33.350 --> 28:34.680
and I've got some clues.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.800
That woman's name is Chen Yunya.

28:36.880 --> 28:39.590
She's the granddaughter of
the owner of Chen's Tea House.

28:39.590 --> 28:41.030
She has a close friend from Jingzhou,

28:41.030 --> 28:42.160
named Dong Fangchun,

28:42.160 --> 28:43.750
who seems to have considerable influence
in the martial world.

28:43.750 --> 28:45.200
The two of them frequent Baiyun Temple,

28:45.200 --> 28:46.790
and they share a very close relationship

28:46.790 --> 28:47.960
with a Taoist named Xin Zhen.

28:47.960 --> 28:49.350
Dong Fangchun and Xin Zhen
conspired together,

28:49.350 --> 28:51.000
using the pretense of
performing ritual ceremonies

28:51.000 --> 28:52.590
to carry out thefts targeting
wealthy households and local gentry.

28:52.590 --> 28:55.720
They've committed crimes in places
such as Yunzhou and Jingzhou.

28:55.720 --> 28:56.920
Dong Fangchun is currently in Hengtang,

28:56.920 --> 28:58.510
running a horse-selling business.

28:58.510 --> 28:59.550
That white horse was

28:59.550 --> 29:00.620
mixed in with other horses

29:00.620 --> 29:02.270
and sold to the Xie family at that time.

29:02.270 --> 29:03.730
And what about Chen Yunya?

29:04.160 --> 29:05.560
Chen Yunya's background

29:05.880 --> 29:07.280
is actually quite clean.

29:07.790 --> 29:09.640
She grew up at Chen's Tea House
from a young age.

29:09.640 --> 29:11.640
There's nothing special about her,

29:13.240 --> 29:14.570
except for her origins.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.550
Her origins?

29:19.630 --> 29:20.720
Chen Yunya is originally

29:20.720 --> 29:22.920
the youngest daughter of the Xie family
who lived away from home.

29:22.920 --> 29:24.790
After that big fire at the Xie Residence
a few days ago,

29:24.790 --> 29:25.790
for some reason,

29:26.000 --> 29:27.310
Old Madam Xie
personally arranged everything

29:27.310 --> 29:28.920
and insisted on bringing her back
to the household.

29:28.920 --> 29:29.920
This is the place.

29:35.940 --> 29:36.300
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

29:38.590 --> 29:40.680
What a long-lost Fourth Lady.

29:41.440 --> 29:44.510
The Xie family must be connected to
the embezzlement case.

29:44.510 --> 29:45.790
Then this Fourth Lady

29:45.830 --> 29:49.270
has actually become the key to
my investigation into the Xie family.

29:49.270 --> 29:49.960
Sir,

29:50.310 --> 29:52.270
please enjoy the pear blossom candy
and Tiny Tip green tea.

29:52.270 --> 29:53.600
Have as much as you like.

29:53.680 --> 29:55.450
If you want anything else,

29:55.640 --> 29:57.160
just let me know at any time.

29:57.160 --> 29:58.220
Thank you, Granny.

30:16.310 --> 30:17.000
Granny,

30:18.240 --> 30:19.960
you've been running this tea house

30:19.960 --> 30:21.560
for quite some years, right?

30:22.720 --> 30:25.220
I've spent more than half of my life

30:25.350 --> 30:27.490
in this little tea house.

30:37.070 --> 30:39.070
Do you have any other pastries here?

30:39.240 --> 30:40.410
Sure.

30:40.640 --> 30:42.190
We have almond crisp,

30:42.270 --> 30:44.390
steamed flower cake, perilla candy,

30:44.480 --> 30:45.680
and many other kinds.

30:48.590 --> 30:49.550
What are you steaming?

30:49.550 --> 30:50.550
It smells so good.

30:51.510 --> 30:54.350
This is my secret-recipe poria cake.

30:55.030 --> 30:56.880
You won't find it anywhere else.

30:58.590 --> 30:59.160
Alright.

30:59.550 --> 31:00.680
Give me one serving.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.360
Well, Sir,

31:04.510 --> 31:06.360
it's not done steaming yet.

31:07.240 --> 31:07.960
Sir,

31:08.510 --> 31:10.040
you look quite unfamiliar.

31:11.000 --> 31:14.400
Judging by your accent,
you're not from around here, are you?

31:15.890 --> 31:16.810
My name is Yan.

31:17.260 --> 31:19.720
I just arrived in Hengtang
from the capital.

31:21.310 --> 31:23.020
The capital's nice.

31:23.220 --> 31:25.240
Our city is small in comparison.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.480
Are you getting used to living here?

31:30.440 --> 31:31.700
It's alright, I guess.

31:32.000 --> 31:32.680
Granny,

31:33.270 --> 31:34.790
your tea house is pretty big.

31:34.790 --> 31:36.650
Can you handle it all by yourself?

31:36.840 --> 31:38.570
I have a granddaughter.

31:40.030 --> 31:40.480
Yeah,

31:40.720 --> 31:41.780
my granddaughter.

31:43.350 --> 31:44.000
Granny!

31:44.310 --> 31:46.350
Are the almond crisp
and pear blossom candy ready yet?

31:46.350 --> 31:47.940
The Li family's waiting!

31:48.110 --> 31:49.310
Look at my memory.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.320
Sir,

31:52.790 --> 31:54.240
I have to go out for a while.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.830
If you need anything else,

31:55.920 --> 31:57.320
j-just help yourself.

31:57.400 --> 32:00.110
The pastry prices are posted
right there on the counter.

32:00.110 --> 32:02.200
The poria cake will be ready in no time.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.260
Don't go anywhere.

32:04.400 --> 32:04.930
Okay.

32:06.510 --> 32:08.000
Coming!

32:25.150 --> 32:30.480
[Letter of Ancestry Reclaiming
of Hengtang's Xie Family]

32:33.440 --> 32:34.270
Dear.

32:35.350 --> 32:36.680
What are you looking at?

32:45.200 --> 32:45.880
Granny.

32:46.830 --> 32:47.750
This is

32:48.030 --> 32:49.960
the invitation sent by the Xie family

32:49.960 --> 32:52.090
for the ancestry reclaiming banquet.

32:53.870 --> 32:56.090
[Letter of Ancestry Reclaiming
of Hengtang's Xie Family]

32:55.070 --> 32:56.270
They're inviting you

32:56.750 --> 32:58.440
to thank you for raising me.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.630
Silly girl.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.420
How could I go?

33:09.790 --> 33:11.720
It wouldn't look right if I went.

33:16.070 --> 33:17.920
Look at you, all listless.

33:18.200 --> 33:19.200
Cheer up.

33:19.720 --> 33:21.650
You've still got a lot to attend to.

33:22.920 --> 33:24.400
I have to go make a delivery.

33:24.400 --> 33:26.660
Keep an eye on the customer inside for me.

33:56.270 --> 33:58.870
The jade soul inherits
the cold moon's spirit;

33:58.960 --> 34:01.290
white silk still wraps traces of the past.

34:01.750 --> 34:04.200
Let not the east wind sweep away
the snow before the steps,

34:04.200 --> 34:08.060
for a hidden fragrance may yet drift out
from behind those deep gates.

34:08.230 --> 34:08.960
Tell me,

34:09.110 --> 34:11.230
do you think that tree out front
has buried beneath it

34:11.230 --> 34:14.830
a great many secrets that were
never meant to see the light of day?

34:19.110 --> 34:20.710
How cold of you.

34:22.590 --> 34:24.989
Don't tell me you've forgotten me already.

34:25.550 --> 34:27.000
Please forgive me, honored guest.

34:27.000 --> 34:29.199
I've had a poor memory since childhood,

34:29.280 --> 34:31.550
especially when it comes to
remembering people's faces.

34:31.550 --> 34:32.750
Please forgive me.

34:35.480 --> 34:37.480
It's okay if you don't recognize me.

34:39.960 --> 34:41.889
That white horse at Fushan Temple—

34:42.760 --> 34:44.090
what was its name again?

34:44.800 --> 34:45.840
Yunduo, right?

34:47.320 --> 34:48.590
What a beautiful name.

34:49.230 --> 34:51.360
Just as beautiful as your name, Yunya.

34:59.880 --> 35:02.140
You don't like such praise, lady, do you?

35:03.400 --> 35:05.000
Then what do you like to hear?

35:05.760 --> 35:07.420
Exceptionally intelligent?

35:07.710 --> 35:09.040
Unmatched in strategy?

35:09.320 --> 35:10.280
Or maybe,

35:11.110 --> 35:13.800
your acting is so superb
that even Old Madam Xie

35:13.840 --> 35:14.970
fell into your trap?

35:19.030 --> 35:21.030
Don't like the sound of that either?

35:22.920 --> 35:24.650
Then let me try something else.

35:26.760 --> 35:29.000
Fugitive Dong Fangchun,

35:30.800 --> 35:32.360
or fake Taoist Xin Zhen?

35:32.360 --> 35:33.760
Now that calamity has befallen you,

35:33.760 --> 35:35.440
there is surely a mascot to ward it off.

35:35.440 --> 35:36.850
So there is a solution?

35:41.440 --> 35:43.370
What is Your Lordship's intention

35:43.440 --> 35:45.240
in pressing me so aggressively?

35:45.550 --> 35:47.480
I should be the one asking you that.

35:48.280 --> 35:50.000
Why were you willing to stop at nothing—

35:50.000 --> 35:52.200
even setting the Xie Residence on fire—

35:52.760 --> 35:54.090
to enter the Xie family?

35:54.760 --> 35:56.280
I never set any fire.

35:57.880 --> 35:58.710
That's true.

35:59.110 --> 36:02.070
It indeed wasn't you, Fourth Lady
of the Xie family, who set the fire,

36:02.070 --> 36:04.240
but Chen Yunya of Chen's Tea House.

36:10.150 --> 36:11.920
I just wonder if Granny Chen

36:12.630 --> 36:15.840
could withstand the punishment
for harboring a criminal.

36:15.840 --> 36:16.480
Yan Rui.

36:16.670 --> 36:17.800
Whatever you want, take it out on me.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.700
Leave Granny out of this.

36:18.700 --> 36:19.380
Tell me,

36:19.960 --> 36:22.690
what is your purpose for
entering the Xie family?

36:32.360 --> 36:34.110
I'm a daughter of the Xie family
to begin with.

36:34.110 --> 36:36.640
What's wrong with
me reclaiming my ancestry?

36:42.990 --> 36:46.190
If I hand over the evidence of your arson
to the Xie family,

36:46.550 --> 36:47.480
do you think

36:48.440 --> 36:50.570
they'll believe you, a fake daughter,

36:51.630 --> 36:52.690
or me, an official?

36:59.440 --> 37:00.280
What,

37:00.840 --> 37:01.900
you want to kill me?

37:03.150 --> 37:03.950
Go ahead then.

37:13.440 --> 37:14.860
I'm back.

37:15.550 --> 37:17.220
Has the customer left?

37:17.320 --> 37:18.150
Dear?

37:18.590 --> 37:19.320
I'm leaving.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.320
From now on,

37:25.550 --> 37:26.810
I'll come visit often.

37:34.060 --> 37:36.630
[Hengtang]

37:38.470 --> 37:41.190
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

37:42.800 --> 37:45.000
The Fourth Lady has arrived.

37:59.550 --> 38:00.150
Mother.

38:01.230 --> 38:01.920
Sorry that

38:03.070 --> 38:04.550
I didn't listen to you

38:05.520 --> 38:07.280
and chose to come back to

38:08.110 --> 38:10.840
the Xie family that caused you
so much suffering.

38:11.960 --> 38:15.480
You always said that vengeance
only breeds more vengeance and never ends.

38:15.480 --> 38:17.540
But in these grand mansions of power,

38:17.760 --> 38:19.550
there is no such thing as reason,

38:19.550 --> 38:20.950
only victory and defeat.

38:21.630 --> 38:23.400
Now that the game has begun,

38:24.130 --> 38:27.270
it's time for me to make my move.

38:28.150 --> 38:28.960
In

38:29.150 --> 38:31.110
the eighth year of Jingxi,

38:31.190 --> 38:33.670
in accordance with
the order of heaven and earth

38:33.670 --> 38:35.400
and the harmony of Yin and Yang,

38:36.110 --> 38:37.940
it is the blessing of the family

38:38.840 --> 38:40.460
that the descendants

38:40.510 --> 38:44.080
always remember
the teachings of their ancestors.

38:44.760 --> 38:46.480
[Xie Qinghe,
Eldest Lady of the Xie Family]

38:44.880 --> 38:47.840
Now, the fourth daughter
of the Xie family,

38:47.360 --> 38:48.980
[Xie Qingru,
Second Lady of the Xie Family]

38:48.070 --> 38:49.670
long separated from her kin

38:49.140 --> 38:51.670
[Xie Qingrong,
Third Lady of the Xie Family]

38:49.920 --> 38:52.320
and is currently 19 years old,

38:52.960 --> 38:54.670
is virtuous and well-mannered.

38:53.790 --> 38:55.900
[Lian Fanqiao,
Third Concubine of the Xie Family]

38:54.840 --> 38:56.630
She honors her ancestors

38:56.920 --> 38:58.360
and spares no hardship

38:58.630 --> 39:00.900
to return to the Xie household.

39:01.230 --> 39:05.540
She shall be received as a daughter
under the care of Head Madam, Lady Hu,

39:02.630 --> 39:04.750
[Hu Wenzhuo,
Head Madam of the Xie Family]

39:05.280 --> 39:08.020
[Old Madam Xie]

39:05.710 --> 39:08.360
inheriting the family lineage.

39:09.590 --> 39:11.670
She is now formally received
into the family,

39:11.670 --> 39:13.510
her birth name,

39:14.150 --> 39:16.190
Xie Qingyuan, restored,

39:14.190 --> 39:16.690
[Xie Qingyuan,
Fourth Lady of the Xie Family]

39:16.970 --> 39:19.800
[Qingyuan]

39:17.320 --> 39:19.120
and entered into the genealogy.

39:20.150 --> 39:21.610
The ceremony is complete.

39:22.710 --> 39:24.510
Congratulations, Fourth Lady,

39:24.800 --> 39:26.150
on returning to the clan.

39:26.150 --> 39:28.760
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
